@startuml SolanaRandomContract
!include ../style.puml
!include ../interfaces/IRandomContract.puml

title SolanaRandomContract Class

class SolanaRandomContract {
    - commitmentAccount: Account
    - secretAccount: Account
    - providerAccount: Account
    - requestAccount: Account
    - programData: ProgramData
    --
    + commit(commitParams: CommitParams)
    + reveal(secretParams: ISecretParams)
    + requestEntropy(requestParams: EntropyRequest): requestId
    + statusEntropy(): EntropyStatus
    --
    - processInstruction(instruction: Instruction): Result
    - validateAccountOwnership(account: PublicKey): bool
    - serializeAccountData(data: any): Buffer
    - deserializeAccountData(buffer: Buffer): any
}

SolanaRandomContract ..|> RandomContract

note right of SolanaRandomContract
  **Solana Program**
  
  Rust implementation of
  RandomContract for Solana
  blockchain with account storage.
end note

@enduml